  "mapA11yDesc": "This interactive map shows where smoke testing is upcoming (orange) and completed (blue) in Peel Region. You can search your address using the tool bar to find out when testing will happen in your neighbourhood.  ",
  "introductionTitle": "",
  "infoIncludeLocation": false,
  "introductionContent": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\"><strong>Using the map</strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">You can search the map in three ways:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal; margin-bottom:0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1. Select the search bar and type in an address</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal; margin-bottom:0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2. Choose <strong>Use current location </strong>in the search bar</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal; margin-bottom:0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3. Click anywhere on the map to explore a neighbourhood</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">Your search results will show if smoke testing is scheduled for your area.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">To start a new search, use the tab at the top of the map named <strong>Clear search location</strong> or the <strong>X</strong> next to your address search. &nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\"><strong>Contact us</strong></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">We encourage you to check back regularly for updates.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">If you have further questions or feedback about the map, please contact Peel Region.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">For more information or to report smoke in your home during testing, call <strong>Peel Region at 905-791-7800, ext. 4409</strong> or visit </span><a href=\"https://peelregion.ca/water/wastewater/sanitary-sewer-smoke-testing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:blue;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">Sanitary sewer smoke testing</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">.</span></p>",
  "landingPage": true,
  "landingPageConfig": {
   "titleText": "Peel Region's Smoke Testing Map Off-Season",
   "subtitleText": "Smoke Testing is suspended from September 2026 through April 2027. Operations will resume in May 2027.",
   "descriptionText": "<p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin:0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:16.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\"><strong>Terms of Use</strong></span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt;\">These terms of use constitute the agreement (“Agreement”) between The Regional Municipality of Peel (“Peel Region”) and the user (“User” or “you”) with respect to the use of the Peel Region's Smoke Testing Map (\"Site\").</span><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\"> </span><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt; line-height:115%;\">By using the Site, you agree to these terms of use. If you do not agree, do not use the Site. The terms of this Agreement are subject to change. Please read carefully.</span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:16.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\"><strong>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; LICENCE</strong></span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:14.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\"><strong>1.1 Licence Grant</strong></span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\">Peel region grants to the User a revocable, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, licence to use the Site in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.</span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margi