kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:16.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\"><strong>4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; INDEMNIFICATION AND WAVER OF LIABILITY</strong></span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:14.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\"><strong>4.1 Indemnification</strong></span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\">The User will indemnify and hold harmless Peel Region from and against all charges, liabilities, losses, damages, costs, and expenses (including reasonable legal fees and disbursements) incurred in connection with any claims, demands, suits, causes of action, actions, or other proceedings resulting from or related to this Agreement and/or the User’s use of the Site or any of the Site’s contents.</span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:14.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\"><strong>4.2 No Liability</strong></span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\">The User uses the Site at the User’s own risk. The User agrees that Peel Region will not be liable to the User for any charges, liabilities, losses, damages, costs, or expenses incurred by the User or any employee, agent, representative, or contractor of the User arising from or related to this Agreement, the Site, and/or the Site’s contents. The User hereby releases and forever discharges Peel Region from any and all claims, demands, causes or action, and actions it may now or in the future have with respect to this Agreement, the Site, and/or the Site's contents.</span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:16.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\"><strong>5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; GENERAL</strong></span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:14.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\"><strong>5.1 Governing Law</strong></span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\">This Agreement will be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Ontario.</span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:14.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\"><strong>5.2 Severability</strong></span></p><p class=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-kerning:none; margin:0in;\"><span class=\"textrun\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:13.0pt; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;\">If any provision of this Agreement is held to be invalid, illegal, or unenforceable, such provision will be severed from this Agreement to the extent it is held to be invalid, illegal, or unenforceable, and the remainder of this Agreement will continue in effect.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:13.0pt; line-height:115%;\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
